This empty file switches on the game's script logging.

Its only job is to exist. It has no file extension on purpose - the game looks
for a file at exactly this path:  script/enable_console_logging

With it present, the game's out() function writes to script_log_DDMMYY_HHMM.txt
in your Total War WARHAMMER III install folder. A new log file is created every
time you enter a battle, a campaign, or the main menu.

Delete this file before you publish the mod: end users do not want their game
writing log files.
